= Diode =

== Overview ==

{{:Diode/Simple}}

A '''diode''' is a nonlinear device whose current–voltage response is usually asymmetric under voltage reversal. This article distinguishes the physical device from an ideal circuit symbol, identifies p–n junction and metal–semiconductor examples, and records which conclusions require particular material, geometry, temperature and frequency assumptions.

